                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "Layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EGreetings Cavalier students and parents! I am Mrs. Ure\u00F1o and I proudly serve students with last names N-Ri at Santiago High School. I pride myself in ensuring that our school\u0027s comprehensive school guidance program, focused on academic, college/career and personal/social emotional counseling, meets the needs of all my students. It is my mission to encourage students to reach their full potential and prepare them for post-high school options. In addition to serving my students, I am also responsible for the following counseling components: Early College Academy University and Community College Liaison Financial Aid 12th grade College \u0026amp; Career Unit Community Schools I look forward to a great school year and the opportunity of working with both my students and their parents. Please feel free to contact me at the Counseling Office or email me if you have any questions or concerns.\u003C/p\u003E"
                    }
                  },
