                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "Layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWelcome to Mrs. Z\u0027s homepage for AP Literature and English 4P/ERWC . Here\u0027s a little bit of information about me: After graduating from San Diego State University with a B.S in Business Administration and Marketing, I worked for a number of years in the technology industry (hardware and software). Although I greatly enjoyed my work, several years ago I was able to attain a long-standing dream of mine: to go back to college to obtain my teaching credential in English. I happily joined the Cavalier staff in the 2003-2004 school year and I have loved it here ever since! Teaching is my passion, and I am both blessed and honored to work with such intelligent, creative, and caring students and staff. For information on classes and homework, please click on the links below. Or click on \u0022Photo Album\u0022 for some pics.\u003C/p\u003E"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "blockVisibility",
